{"title": "Ascendant Bite", "pageid": 23175, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Ascendant_Bite", "categories": ["Class actions", "Bonus actions", "Sources of Necrotic damage"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Bulette_Bite.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7a/Bulette_Bite.webp/300px-Bulette_Bite.webp, /w/images/7/7a/Bulette_Bite.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7a/Bulette_Bite.webp/300px-Bulette_Bite.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7a/Bulette_Bite.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure><b>Ascendant Bite</b> is a class action usable only by <a href=\"/wiki/Astarion\" title=\"Astarion\">Astarion</a> if he completed his <a href=\"/wiki/The_Pale_Elf\" title=\"The Pale Elf\">quest</a> by ascending. Ascendant Bite behaves similarly to <a href=\"/wiki/Vampire_Bite\" title=\"Vampire Bite\">Vampire Bite</a>, healing <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-healing\">6d6</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Healing\" title=\"Healing\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/20px-Healing_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/30px-Healing_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/40px-Healing_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Hit Points\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/20px-Healing_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Hit_points\" title=\"Hit points\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-healing\">Hit Points</span></a> damage and dealing <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-necrotic\">6d6</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Necrotic\" title=\"Necrotic\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Necrotic\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Necrotic\" title=\"Necrotic\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-necrotic\">Necrotic</span></a> damage to the target.\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Suck the blood from a living creature to heal yourself. \n</p><p>If the target is humanoid, you become <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Happy_(Condition)\" title=\"Happy (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/61/Happy_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Happy_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/61/Happy_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Happy_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/61/Happy_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Happy_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Happy\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/61/Happy_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Happy_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/61/Happy_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Happy_(Condition)\" title=\"Happy (Condition)\">Happy</a> and the target becomes <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bloodless_(Condition)\" title=\"Bloodless (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d8/Bloodless_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Bloodless_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d8/Bloodless_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Bloodless_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d8/Bloodless_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Bloodless_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Bloodless\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d8/Bloodless_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Bloodless_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d8/Bloodless_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Bloodless_(Condition)\" title=\"Bloodless (Condition)\">Bloodless</a>\n</p>\nBiting a creature does not break stealth.<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dl><dt>Cost</dt>\n<dd><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/28px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/42px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/28px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Resources\" title=\"Actions\">Bonus Action</a></dd><dt>Damage: 6~36</dt><dd class=\"bg3wiki-damage-display\" style=\"margin-left:0px\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;width:fit-content\"><span style=\"display:block;position:relative;width:30px;height:30px;margin-left:0px;padding-top:0px;margin-right:2px\"><span style=\"z-index:0;position:absolute;transform:translate( 0%, 0%)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/D6_Necrotic.png/27px-D6_Necrotic.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fe/D6_Necrotic.png/40px-D6_Necrotic.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fe/D6_Necrotic.png/54px-D6_Necrotic.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/D6_Necrotic.png/27px-D6_Necrotic.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"27\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/fe/D6_Necrotic.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><div><div style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-necrotic\">6d6</span><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Necrotic\" title=\"Necrotic\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Necrotic\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Necrotic\" title=\"Necrotic\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-necrotic\">Necrotic</span></a> (to target)</div></div></div></dd><dt>Healing: 6~36</dt><dd class=\"bg3wiki-damage-display\" style=\"margin-left:0px\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;width:fit-content\"><span style=\"display:block;position:relative;width:30px;height:30px;margin-left:0px;padding-top:0px;margin-right:2px\"><span style=\"z-index:0;position:absolute;transform:translate( 0%, 0%)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/74/D6_Healing.png/27px-D6_Healing.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/74/D6_Healing.png/40px-D6_Healing.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/74/D6_Healing.png/54px-D6_Healing.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/74/D6_Healing.png/27px-D6_Healing.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"27\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/7/74/D6_Healing.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><div><div style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-healing\">6d6</span><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Healing\" title=\"Healing\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/20px-Healing_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/30px-Healing_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/40px-Healing_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Healing\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/20px-Healing_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Healing\" title=\"Healing\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-healing\">Healing</span></a> (to self)</div></div></div></dd>\n<dt>Details</dt>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2a/Melee_Range_Icon.png/25px-Melee_Range_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/2a/Melee_Range_Icon.png/38px-Melee_Range_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/2/2a/Melee_Range_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Melee: 1.5 m (5 ft)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2a/Melee_Range_Icon.png/25px-Melee_Range_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/2a/Melee_Range_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Melee: 1.5 m (5 ft)</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/38px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Recharge: Short rest\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Recharge: <a href=\"/wiki/Short_rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Short rest\">Short rest</a></dd></dl>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"noexcerpt mw-collapsed mw-collapsible nomobile\">\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Technical_details\">Technical details <span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle-placeholder\"></span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mw-collapsible-content\"><div style=\"display: flex\">\n  <div><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> UID</div>\n  <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: min-content auto; grid-gap: 6px; margin-left: 6px;\">  \n  <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\" style=\"margin:0 0 auto\">Target_LOW_Astarion_VampireAscendant</code><div><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Target_LOW_Astarion_VampireAscendant\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Target_LOW_Astarion_VampireAscendant\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div>\n  </div>\n</div><div style=\"display: flex; margin-top: 12px\">\n  <div style=\"margin-right:6px\"><span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/25px-Ico_Report.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/38px-Ico_Report.webp 1.5x, /w/images/8/88/Ico_Report.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico Report.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/25px-Ico_Report.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/8/88/Ico_Report.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Spell flags</span></div>\n  <div><code><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=CannotTargetItems_(spell_flag)&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"CannotTargetItems (spell flag) (page does not exist)\">CannotTargetItems</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=CannotTargetTerrain_(spell_flag)&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"CannotTargetTerrain (spell flag) (page does not exist)\">CannotTargetTerrain</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/IsHarmful_(spell_flag)\" title=\"IsHarmful (spell flag)\">IsHarmful</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/IsMelee_(spell_flag)\" title=\"IsMelee (spell flag)\">IsMelee</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/Stealth_(spell_flag)\" title=\"Stealth (spell flag)\">Stealth</a></code></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div><div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Happy\"> Condition: Happy </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Happy_(Condition)\" title=\"Happy (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/61/Happy_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Happy_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/61/Happy_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Happy_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/61/Happy_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Happy_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Happy\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/61/Happy_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Happy_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/61/Happy_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Happy_(Condition)\" title=\"Happy (Condition)\">Happy</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: Until <a href=\"/wiki/Long_rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Long rest\">Long rest</a></p>\n<div>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Astarion\" title=\"Astarion\">Astarion's</a> vampiric hunger has been temporarily sated. +1 to all <a href=\"/wiki/Attack_Rolls\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Attack Rolls\">Attack Rolls</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_Throws\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving Throws\">Saving Throws</a>, and most <a href=\"/wiki/Ability_Check\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ability Check\">Ability Checks</a>.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Bloodless\"> Condition: Bloodless </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bloodless_(Condition)\" title=\"Bloodless (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d8/Bloodless_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Bloodless_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d8/Bloodless_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Bloodless_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d8/Bloodless_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Bloodless_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Bloodless\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d8/Bloodless_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Bloodless_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d8/Bloodless_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Bloodless_(Condition)\" title=\"Bloodless (Condition)\">Bloodless</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: Until <a href=\"/wiki/Long_rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Long rest\">Long rest</a></p>\n<div>\n<ul><li>Feels a bit woozy. -1 to all <a href=\"/wiki/Attack_Rolls\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Attack Rolls\">Attack Rolls</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_Throws\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving Throws\">Saving Throws</a>, and most <a href=\"/wiki/Ability_Check\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ability Check\">Ability Checks</a>.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Other ways to learn:<br>\n</p>\n<ul><li>Only able to be learned by <a href=\"/wiki/Astarion\" title=\"Astarion\">Astarion</a> after becoming an ascendant vampire.</li></ul>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Ascendant Bite does not replace <a href=\"/wiki/Vampire_Bite\" title=\"Vampire Bite\">Vampire Bite</a>; both attacks will be available after ascending.</li>\n<li>Cannot be used on <a href=\"/wiki/Undead\" title=\"Undead\">Undead</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Plant\" title=\"Plant\">Plant</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Elemental\" title=\"Elemental\">Elemental</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Ooze\" title=\"Ooze\">Ooze</a>, and <a href=\"/wiki/Construct\" title=\"Construct\">Construct</a> creature types.</li>\n<li>Cannot be used on creatures that are <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Petrified_(Condition)\" title=\"Petrified (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c0/Petrified_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Petrified_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c0/Petrified_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Petrified_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c0/Petrified_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Petrified_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Petrified\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c0/Petrified_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Petrified_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c0/Petrified_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Petrified_(Condition)\" title=\"Petrified (Condition)\">Petrified</a>.</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715034747\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.097 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.103 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 4535/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 73973/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 29733/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 26/200\nExpensive parser function count: 3/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 4/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 36/1000\nLua time usage: 0.026/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1312637/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n123.14%  105.478     65 Template:Trim\n100.00%   85.658      1 Template:Feature_page\n100.00%   85.658      1 -total\n 28.11%   24.078     11 Template:Icon_text\n 25.60%   21.926      9 Template:Icon_link\n 14.49%   12.408      2 Template:Condition\n 14.16%   12.132      2 Template:DamageText\n 13.00%   11.139      2 Template:SmCond\n 12.98%   11.117      1 Template:Feature_page/technical_section\n 12.62%   10.806      2 Template:Damage_type\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:p